  "question": {
    "text": "For &#39;invert sugar&#39;, the correct statement(s) is (are)<br />(Given: specific rotations of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mo>+</mo></mfenced><mo>-</mo></math>sucrose, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mo>+</mo></mfenced><mo>-</mo></math>maltose, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mo>-</mo></mfenced><mo>-</mo></math>glucose and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mo>+</mo></mfenced><mo>-</mo></math>fructose in aqueous solution are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mn>66</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>140</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#8211;</mo><msup><mn>52</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></msup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mn>92</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></msup></math>, respectively)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
