    {
      "id": "tHFoP",
      "text": "&#39;invert sugar&#39; is an equimolar mixture of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mo>+</mo></mfenced></math> glucose and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mo>-</mo></mfenced><mo>-</mo></math> fructose.",
